@HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Tips
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tips?difficulty=Beginner
Accept: application/json

### Live tips (SSE)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tips/realtime
Accept: text/event-stream

### Leaderboard
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/leaderboard?top=10
Accept: application/json

### Submit a score
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/leaderboard
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerName": "Hilthon",
  "score": 420,
  "level": 3,
  "snakeLength": 43
}

### Live leaderboard changes (SSE)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/leaderboard/realtime
Accept: text/event-stream

### Health
GET {{HostAddress}}/health
